steps.text:
Yes—`MuiPaginationItem` is the correct name for Material-UI v4’s theme customization API.

At the time of that report, both the docs and implementation used `PaginationItem`; it was an inconsistency/bug. It was subsequently corrected in the implementation to `MuiPaginationItem` in [the follow-up change](https://github.com/mui/material-ui/commit/9c053f85f0353cfc5ede1ce8cc0a87a618675277).

Use:

```js
const theme = createMuiTheme({
  overrides: {
    MuiPaginationItem: {
      root: { /* … */ },
    },
  },
  props: {
    MuiPaginationItem: {
      // default props
    },
  },
});
```

So: `PaginationItem` was not the intended theme key; `MuiPaginationItem` is.
